---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About UConvertDocument" seo={{ page_description: "Learn more about UConvertDocument, a free online document converter tool." }}>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 prose">
    <h1>About UConvertDocument</h1>
    <p>UConvertDocument is a free online document format converter tool. We provide fast, secure, and easy-to-use tools for converting PDFs to Word documents, merging PDFs, converting images to PDFs, and more.</p>
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>Our mission is to make document conversion accessible to everyone without the need for expensive software or complex installations.</p>
    <h2>Why Choose Us?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Free to use</strong>: No hidden fees or subscriptions.</li>
      <li><strong>Secure</strong>: Your files are processed securely and deleted from our servers automatically.</li>
      <li><strong>Fast</strong>: Get your converted files in seconds.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Layout>
